# ── Site URL ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The deployed URL, used by the sitemap and llms-txt to emit absolute URLs.
# Set it here, or replace the `https://example.com` fallback in
# astro.config.mjs — they are the same setting, and this variable wins as long
# as the `DOCS_SITE_URL ||` in front of that fallback stays put. Useful when
# one build serves several environments (a preview deployment and production
# have different URLs).
# DOCS_SITE_URL=https://docs.example.com
